OL,3,GNEWSASteven Daniel in court on
OL,4,Aorganised crime charges after
OL,5,A'gangland' raid
OL,6,
OL,7,FSteven Daniel has appeared in court in
OL,8,FGlasgow charged in connection with
OL,9,Fserious and organised crime and drugs
OL,10,Foffences.
OL,12,FHe was arrested in an early morning
OL,13,Fraid as part of Operation Venetic, a
OL,14,Fmajor UK-wide operation that has
OL,15,Fdismantled several gangs.
OL,17,FDaniel, 46, was taken into custody at
OL,18,Fabout 06:00 on Wednesday from his home
OL,19,Fin Robroyston in the north of Glasgow.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
